  "goodToKnow": "Der Befürworter (die Befürworterin) is a supporter or advocate of a plan, policy or idea: Befürworter und Gegner (supporters and opponents) is the standard pairing in news reports. The verb is befürworten (to endorse): Die Regierung befürwortet den Plan. Literally, it means to put in a word (Wort) for (für) something. Plural: die Befürworter."
